  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with the custom Galaxy Football Flag Comforter by Jeminise. Perfect for football players, fans, and coaches, this high-quality bedding features a vibrant sports design that brings the energy of the game into your home decor. Customizable with text options, this comforter is designed to deliver both modern style and exceptional comfort.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Customized Design:</strong> Features up to two text inputs for names, numbers, or custom messages to create a personalized sports keepsake.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester fabric with whole-piece microfiber filling to prevent clumping and shifting.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Perfectly sized for Twin (68\" x 88\"), Full (78\" x 88\"), Queen (88\" x 88\"), and King (104\" x 88\") beds.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Set includes 1 comforter (or duvet cover) with optional matching pillowcases and flat sheet covers.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying microfiber becomes fluffier with each wash.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Galaxy Football Flag</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Galaxy</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
